{"jacket":[{"c":"This jacket is a little too big.","cn":"這件夾克有點太大了。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #58431 (CK) & #907509 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/58431"},{"c":"Can I try on this jacket?","cn":"我可以試穿這件外套嗎？","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #61040 (CK) & #1261431 (tsayng)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/61040"}],"jail":[{"c":"Have you ever been in jail?","cn":"你去过监狱吗？","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #6898671 (CK) & #8686687 (crescat)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/6898671"},{"c":"How long were you in jail?","cn":"你在监狱里呆了多久？","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #5478202 (CK) & #5660519 (verdastelo9604)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/5478202"}],"jam":[{"c":"I was delayed by a traffic jam.","cn":"我被交通堵塞耽擱了。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #266568 (CK) & #887805 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/266568"},{"c":"She made jam from the apples.","cn":"她用蘋果做了果醬。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #311145 (CK) & #801977 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/311145"}],"janitor":[{"c":"Tom started as a janitor, but he's now the president of the company.","cn":"汤姆最初是看门人，但现在他是公司的总裁了。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #3669233 (Hybrid) & #8688136 (slo_oth)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/3669233"}],"january":[{"c":"I'm taking an exam in January.","cn":"我一月份要参加考试。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #27825 (CK) & #334499 (fucongcong)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/27825"},{"c":"January is usually the coldest month.","cn":"一月通常是最冷的月份。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #73176 (CK) & #10752760 (GlossaMatik)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/73176"}],"japan":[{"c":"Four is an unlucky number in Japan.","cn":"4在日本是一个不幸的数字。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #1333500 (CK) & #791500 (fucongcong)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/1333500"},{"c":"He came to Japan seven years ago.","cn":"他七年前來日本。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #288649 (CK) & #890474 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/288649"}],"japanese":[{"c":"A Japanese wouldn't do such a thing.","cn":"日本人不會做這種事。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #281712 (CK) & #798257 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/281712"},{"c":"Do Japanese people eat sushi every day?","cn":"日本人每天都会吃寿司吗？","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #3255262 (celeriac) & #8865163 (crescat)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/3255262"}],"jar":[{"c":"There are some cookies in the jar.","cn":"罐子裡有一些餅乾。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #32097 (CK) & #895191 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/32097"},{"c":"Tom has a large jar of pennies.","cn":"湯姆有一大罐零錢。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #5997702 (Hybrid) & #6134979 (verdastelo9604)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/5997702"}],"jaw":[{"c":"He got a broken jaw and lost some teeth.","cn":"他磕碎了下巴，掉了几颗牙。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #294880 (CK) & #812212 (fucongcong)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/294880"}],"jazz":[{"c":"He likes jazz and so do I.","cn":"他喜欢爵士乐，我也是。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #707260 (papabear) & #345748 (fucongcong)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/707260"},{"c":"He likes jazz, and so do I.","cn":"他喜欢爵士乐，我也是。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #290130 (CK) & #345748 (fucongcong)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/290130"}],"jealous":[{"c":"I suppose I felt a little jealous.","cn":"我想我感到有點嫉妒。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #52002 (CK) & #803709 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/52002"},{"c":"He was jealous of my success.","cn":"他嫉妒我的成功。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #297923 (CK) & #848444 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/297923"}],"jealousy":[{"c":"Jealousy was the motive for the murder.","cn":"嫉妒是謀殺的動機。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #265007 (Dejo) & #801436 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/265007"},{"c":"Her success made her the target of jealousy.","cn":"她的成功讓她受盡嫉妒。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #309492 (CM) & #5698048 (verdastelo9604)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/309492"}],"jeans":[{"c":"I got a hole in my jeans.","cn":"我的牛仔褲破了一個洞。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #53894 (CK) & #804619 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/53894"},{"c":"Jeans are now in fashion among girls.","cn":"现在女生穿牛仔裤很流行。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #267214 (CM) & #346767 (fucongcong)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/267214"}],"jelly":[{"c":"I like grape jelly best.","cn":"葡萄味的果凍是我最喜歡的。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #261563 (CK) & #8824089 (xjjAstrus)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/261563"}],"jerk":[{"c":"You're such a jerk.","cn":"你真是個傻子。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #2220319 (Hybrid) & #6147573 (verdastelo9604)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/2220319"}],"jesus":[{"c":"We are here in the name of Jesus Christ and King Charles.","cn":"我們這裡以耶穌基督和查理斯國王之名。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #247883 (CM) & #844520 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/247883"}],"jet":[{"c":"The jet landed at Tokyo.","cn":"這架客機降落在東京了。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #53697 (CK) & #793953 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/53697"}],"jewelry":[{"c":"They broke into the jewelry shop.","cn":"他們闖進了珠寶店。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #305853 (CK) & #874695 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/305853"},{"c":"Mary doesn't usually wear jewelry.","cn":"玛丽通常不戴首饰。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #4132346 (CK) & #5715140 (verdastelo9604)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/4132346"}],"job":[{"c":"Can you help me find a job?","cn":"你能幫我找一個工作嗎？","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #3114078 (CK) & #9210031 (xjjAstrus)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/3114078"},{"c":"Do you want this job or not?","cn":"你想不想要這工作？","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #2012907 (CK) & #6860868 (verdastelo9604)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/2012907"}],"join":[{"c":"Which group do you want to join?","cn":"你想加入哪一組？","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #69853 (CK) & #900703 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/69853"},{"c":"I'd like to join your group.","cn":"我想加入你们的团对。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #71562 (CK) & #1446893 (asosan)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/71562"}],"joke":[{"c":"He said it merely as a joke.","cn":"他这么说就是为了开玩笑。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #301417 (CK) & #829322 (fucongcong)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/301417"},{"c":"It was just a joke. Lighten up!","cn":"只是个玩笑。放松点!","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #601258 (darinmex) & #818811 (fucongcong)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/601258"}],"journal":[{"c":"My dad keeps a journal every day.","cn":"我爸爸每天都记日记。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #1266470 (yifen238) & #345920 (fucongcong)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/1266470"},{"c":"Do you keep a journal?","cn":"你记日记吗？","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #6013598 (CK) & #396625 (GlossaMatik)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/6013598"}],"journalist":[{"c":"I want to be a journalist.","cn":"我想成为记者。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #2708737 (CK) & #2782527 (iMaple)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/2708737"},{"c":"You're an excellent journalist.","cn":"你是个优秀的记者。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #10540037 (DaoSeng) & #7779227 (jiangche)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/10540037"}],"journey":[{"c":"He made a journey around the world.","cn":"他環遊世界旅行。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #300272 (CK) & #910326 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/300272"},{"c":"I made a long journey last year.","cn":"我去年做了一次長途旅行。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #321753 (CM) & #910325 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/321753"}],"judge":[{"c":"Don't judge a book by its cover.","cn":"不要根据封面来判断一本书。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #322083 (CK) & #406728 (fucongcong)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/322083"},{"c":"Don't judge a man by his clothes.","cn":"不要以穿著來判斷一個人。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #270184 (CK) & #889125 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/270184"}],"judgement":[{"c":"We can rely on his judgement.","cn":"我們可以信賴他的判斷。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #22732 (CK) & #802022 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/22732"}],"judgment":[{"c":"I've always trusted your judgment.","cn":"我一直都相信你的判断。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #3728581 (CM) & #7704620 (leafjensen)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/3728581"}],"juice":[{"c":"She squeezed the juice from many oranges.","cn":"她用了許多柳橙來榨汁。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #388705 (CK) & #894017 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/388705"},{"c":"We don't have any more orange juice.","cn":"我們沒有柳橙汁了。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #9462179 (CK) & #13539897 (LeviHighway)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/9462179"}],"july":[{"c":"The weather is usually hot in July.","cn":"七月天氣經常很熱。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #72370 (CK) & #900266 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/72370"},{"c":"He was born on July 28th, 1888.","cn":"他出生於1888年7月28日。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #6054 (CK) & #881870 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/6054"}],"jump":[{"c":"See how high you can jump.","cn":"看看你能跳多高。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #2744935 (sharptoothed) & #6147593 (verdastelo9604)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/2744935"},{"c":"You must not jump to conclusions.","cn":"你不可以妄下結論。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #52191 (CK) & #870049 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/52191"}],"june":[{"c":"I'm getting married to her in June.","cn":"我將在六月跟他結婚。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #308579 (CK) & #891143 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/308579"},{"c":"My daughter is getting married in June.","cn":"我女兒六月要結婚了。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #1595204 (CM) & #13575738 (LeviHighway)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/1595204"}],"jungle":[{"c":"Looking down, we saw a concrete jungle.","cn":"我們往下看，是一片水泥叢林。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #10540424 (sundown) & #3158529 (cienias)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/10540424"},{"c":"He wrote a book about a jungle adventure.","cn":"他写了一本关于丛林冒险的书。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #1476792 (weihaiping) & #1328149 (vicch)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/1476792"}],"junior":[{"c":"I'm not a junior high school student.","cn":"我不是個初中生。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #259439 (CK) & #891746 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/259439"},{"c":"I'm a junior high school student.","cn":"我是個國中生。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #252301 (CK) & #881031 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/252301"}],"junk":[{"c":"Tom has accumulated a lot of junk.","cn":"湯姆屯了很多垃圾。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #1025447 (CK) & #9170399 (xjjAstrus)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/1025447"},{"c":"Tom used to eat a lot of junk food.","cn":"汤姆以前经常吃很多垃圾食品。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #1830450 (CK) & #8931400 (crescat)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/1830450"}],"jupiter":[{"c":"How many moons does Jupiter have?","cn":"木星有幾個衛星？","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #1820916 (Amastan) & #4265886 (egg0073)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/1820916"},{"c":"Jupiter is the largest planet in the Solar System.","cn":"木星是太陽系中最大的行星。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #499549 (blay_paul) & #4265892 (egg0073)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/499549"}],"jury":[{"c":"The jury looked shocked.","cn":"陪審團看起來很震驚。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #3721521 (CM) & #13504855 (LeviHighway)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/3721521"}],"just":[{"c":"Did you just get to know him?","cn":"你是不是刚认识他？","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #785437 (hrin) & #784403 (fucongcong)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/785437"},{"c":"He got to school just in time.","cn":"他刚好准时到校。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #291723 (CK) & #335121 (fucongcong)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/291723"}],"justice":[{"c":"Justice will prevail in the end.","cn":"正义终将胜利。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #243905 (CM) & #5907524 (verdastelo9604)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/243905"}],"justify":[{"c":"The end does not always justify the means.","cn":"為了正當目的並非總是可以不擇手段.","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #323820 (CK) & #793969 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/323820"}]}
